# --- Python / OS ---
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.DS_Store

# --- virtual environments (regenerate per sub-project; encode absolute paths) ---
.venv/

# --- runtime / scratch ---
.dashboard.pid
*.tmp
*.tmp.*

# --- training logs ---
sbi-logs/

# --- trained model weights: regenerable by training; *_history.json IS kept ---
# *.pt was a size rule ("torch checkpoints are big") and, like *.parquet before it, silently became a
# judgement about evidentiary value: it excluded every trained model from every clone. The FINAL weights
# behind published claims are not regenerable -- cnn_w64.pt is the workhorse for the 4,120-yr background,
# the null, and every coincidence result, and its O3a training strain was purged after scoring, so no
# amount of compute recovers it. Those are tracked below (~31 MB, stated exclusions).
#
# Deliberately still excluded, because these ARE working files rather than evidence:
#   *_ckpt.pt          101 MB  mid-training state, superseded by the final weights beside them
#   diag_*.pt           87 MB  exploratory clip/lr sweep; its CONCLUSIONS are in RESULTS.md
#   11_tonecount_*.pt  7.3 MB  the 10-variant v4 tone-count diagnostic chain (parked negative)
#   19_npe_n*.pt       7.0 MB  amortization-vs-N sweep
*.pt
!primordial_blackhole_search/models/cnn.pt
!primordial_blackhole_search/models/cnn_w64.pt
!primordial_blackhole_search/models/cnn_hl.pt
!primordial_blackhole_search/models/transformer.pt
!primordial_blackhole_search/models/ssl_encoder.pt
!primordial_blackhole_search/models/semicoherent_v1def.pt
!primordial_blackhole_search/models/semicoherent_v2.pt
!echoes/results/07_scorer_H1.pt
!echoes/results/07_scorer_L1.pt
!ringdown_spectroscopy/results/08_posterior.pt
!ringdown_spectroscopy/results/09_posterior_150k.pt

# --- bulky result arrays: the small result JSONs + PNGs ARE committed as the
#     scientific record; verify.sh's one tiny scorer .npy is whitelisted ---
# *.parquet was a rule aimed at "parquet means bulk data". It silently became a judgement about
# EVIDENTIARY VALUE and swept 1.3 MB of per-detector injection scores out of every clone -- the exact
# tables our own standing note tells us to check before recording an experiment as blocked on missing
# data, and which cannot be regenerated because the strain they came from was purged after scoring.
# (Species named by ansatz via the coordination channel: "an ignore rule chosen for size is not a
# judgement about evidentiary value, and it silently becomes one.")  Bulk parquet stays ignored;
# the retained score tables are evidence and are tracked.
*.parquet
!primordial_blackhole_search/results/*.parquet
*.npy
!echoes/results/07_ml_scorer.npy

# --- per-run heartbeat caches ---
**/results/progress/

# --- raw strain anywhere (regenerable from GWOSC; e.g. spike/output/) ---
*.hdf5

# --- large regenerable data (re-fetch from GWOSC / rebuild), keep the manifest ---
**/data/**
!**/data/manifest.json
